[FILE:333:descriptions/desc.single]
Synchronize calendars and contacts.

Vdirsyncer synchronizes your calendars and addressbooks between two
storages. The most popular purpose is to synchronize CalDAV and CardDAV
with a local folder or file.

The local data can then be accessed via a variety of programs, none of
which have to know or worry about syncing to a server.


